      },
      "text": "Buenos Aires to Puerto Madryn via Trelew, with whale watching"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "daa3bc876043e17e46636b4f3ffc3bb8b379bcebb626ae4c633be5d4185f0a02",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-97d3eeec2bfb-mw9olsy5",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to the airport for your flight to Trelew.\n\nOn arrival, continue to Puerto Madryn. The drive takes about 45 minutes.\n\nAfter checking into your hotel, head to El Doradillo Beach, where you can watch whales from the shore. The timing depends on the tides.\n\nThe whales come close enough to shore for you to see them with their calves and take photos from land. This is one of the more relaxed wildlife-watching days on the itinerary. There’s no need for a boat at this point, since the whales are visible right from the coast."
    },
